{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-17_end",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-17",
  "title": "昂首，足践烈焰",
  "storyCode": "JT8-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-17_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a294b156aadfa659c3181a163dc2f30acb16776fd876f1b3e6eb0e1c20b7f0e5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“不死的黑蛇”",
      "text": "做得好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“不死的黑蛇”",
      "text": "做得真好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“不死的黑蛇”",
      "text": "这是什么？斩龙的剑没能斩我，魔王的剑没能刺穿我，为什么......我的法术......我的掌控力，还在消退？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "火焰正逐渐消退。虽然那温度依然足以杀人，但已不再有数分钟前那样暴烈。\n陈染血的手颤抖不止。她几乎不再眨眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "你感到欣喜吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "这滋味好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "你们如此接近胜利，表情却为何还这样凝重？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "胜利近在你们眼前......不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......唔呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "法术解开了......能说话了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "阿米娅，别大意。我们的体力也......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "你们想要将我自这具身躯中驱除？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "请吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你这是在嘲蔑谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "魔王，魔王，你为何一言不发？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "将我逐出她的身体，你们，你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "你能做得到的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "审判她与审判我又有什么区别？难道这一切不是我犯下的罪恶吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "魔王？回答我吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "你说的没错，科西切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "如果她完完全全不愿意的话，那些事......你是做不了的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "属于你的那些想法......无论是不是被扭曲过，那都确实来自......塔露拉本人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "你想伤害塔露拉小姐的肉体？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你要做什么？！把剑放下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "你见过有人在你面前自刎吗，“妹妹”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "就算是德拉克的肉体也没可能承受这把剑的锋利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "我做不了她不想做的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "那么，塔露拉还能继续活下去吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你想都别想！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "她心底的绝望，无法摆脱的耻辱，是否足够浓郁，浓郁到让她想要——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "自尽？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "科西切！你对塔露拉小姐做的一切......都是没法被原谅的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "不管你是不是只是她身上的一个影子，或者是她苏醒的一个障碍，还是说你就是她的另一面......无论塔露拉犯了多少错，你都不可能是对的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "我只是在“教育”她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "我的失败源自我依然还存在的坚持。等你们遇到没有坚持的人就会了解到，痛苦这个词汇里，到底包含多少东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "就像她那些可悲的成为了她牺牲品的乌萨斯战士们，也只是她脚下的坚实道路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "这些感染者，这些可悲的感染者，明明是该发挥它们那世俗不容的价值的感染者们......现在也浪费了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "即使是我也只是她脚下的路。如果我成功杀了你的话，“妹妹”......之后就不会有那么多事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "你可以说我们是黑蛇，也可以说，我就是塔露拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "陈晖洁呀，陈晖洁。塔露拉与我也只是各式父女中的其中一种罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "也许魏彦吾与我也很像。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你还好意思这么说？！牺牲自己的“女儿”？他和你一点都不像！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "不，不对......你不能——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "已经晚了，魔王。我不会让我的秘密被你们拿下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "科西切，你想杀死陈小姐，是因为你想彻底杀死塔露拉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "现在，你做不到了。我们唤起的她的记忆，已经在她脑海中回荡了足够长的时间。她没办法再忍受了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "塔露拉小姐！请你记住......请你回想起来你自己是谁！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "无论是怎样的牺牲，如果是你的话......你才会是那个想第一个去为了他们牺牲的人不是吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "想一想霜星，想一想浮士德......想一想所有相信你的战士，以及想一想你自己！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "你真的想就这样被我们取走生命吗......！以这副任人摆弄的身体死去，你不会心甘情愿的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "如果你要是感到悔恨，要是会因此感到罪恶，也应该作为你自己，而不是一个诅咒的承载体，一个远古邪恶的受害者来承担......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "哪怕你想要死去，你也得作为塔露拉而死！作为那个想要改变雪原，改变感染者命运的塔露拉而死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "塔露拉小姐，我知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我知道你不是为了事业成功才去为了感染者而战的......哪怕失败了那也没有关系！你这么做，是因为你认为这么做是对的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "所以，无论我们面对的是怎么样的人、怎么样的大地......我们不都是会走下去，走到我们真的能够倒下为止吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "你不就是这样坚定的人吗......你所认识的，不都是那样坚定的人吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "塔露拉，你就甘心做这条蛇的傀儡吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你就甘心这样结束？这是我认识的塔露拉吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你这样也配做......感染者的领袖吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "难道......说......塔露拉小姐......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这绝不是白发的德拉克第一次反抗自己的“父亲”。\n感染者的领袖......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他教育给自己的一切都是他的阴谋。而阴谋是赤裸裸的表达。\n即使她知道这一切，但她还是没能阻止自己。\n在她憎恨那些她无法忍受的事情之前，她首先......\n憎恨自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "够了。到这里就可以了。我已经不再是你了，科西切。我和你是不同的......我不是另一条黑蛇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我也许像个科西切......但我不是另一条黑蛇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "你的诅咒必须在今天断绝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "......我的仇恨已经杀了太多人了。你休想再用仇恨去煽动我哪怕一分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "呵，科西切，你所承载的你那无数代的仇怨和故事......在我这一代就会结束。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "你是种子，你是藤蔓，你是参天大树......没关系，科西切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我可是火。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "“是我教给你这一切”？不，不，科西切，这片大地，那片雪原，那些追逐阳光的人，他们教给我的东西，你永远不可能理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "能够驾驭我力量的人早就在那了。即使你让我失去了他们......你也不可能再操控我的情感了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我的火会把你我一同烧穿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "居然......居然！你想反对我？你怎么能——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "......我怎么可能让你从我的尖牙中逃走？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "不是因为阴谋破产而气恼，而是因为发现自己控制不了这个人而恼怒吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "控制？她是我......我就是她！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "那是当然的，科西切......德拉克的女儿怎么会像你这条爬虫一样阴暗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "陈，陈小姐？那个话可不能......不能让斐迪亚干员们听见！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "啊。我也曾经有个蛇上司，她可是个心口如一的人......不打紧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "但是你，科西切，你失败的原因只有一个，那就是你不配。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你不配占据我姐姐的身体。你不配去发动一场战争。甚至，你根本配不上你所说的你的经历。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "所以，现在，给我从塔露拉的身体里......滚出去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "看来真得在离开之前......你们难道真以为你们能阻止核心城？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "——不可以！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "只要我在这里结束这条生命，这一切依然会流动向前，你们怎么阻止得了乌萨斯——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......难道她不是你的女......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "还在追索我的情感？混种的魔王......即使这是事实，你也没有把它说出来的资格！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "......哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "哼，但你说的也对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "终归会有下一个切尔诺伯格和下一个清醒的傀儡，也会有下一个塔露拉的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "我就承认，这一次，你们就尽情庆祝自己的壮举吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "无所谓......已经无所谓了。记好了，塔露拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "“即使在这大地的尽头也会有我。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "白发的德拉克颓然跪倒在地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......结束了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "别动！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我们还不能确定这......是不是那条老蛇的诡计，不知道塔露拉是不是真的在脑海里除掉他了，还是说她真的对自己做的这些感到后悔了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "而且，不，还没结束......我们还得把这座城市停下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "想停下城市就把那东西给我，兔子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "什么......？W？你是从哪里......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "秘钥！再不弄的话就来不及了！不把这个大铁块停下，大家一起完蛋！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我......我不能相信一个敌人。杀害了我们罗德岛同僚的敌人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "那你要怎么相信我？这样吧，读我的心好了。别人要这么做我会让他们从脚底板开始开花，但现在的话，给你看一两眼也没问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "而且，兔子......你不相信我也没关系。我也不信你。但我相信特蕾西娅的继承人不至于在这时候犯傻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "如果你肯把东西给我，城市停下以后你杀了我也行。我不会站在那给你杀的，但我可以给你个机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "要知道，大多数人我根本不会给这个机会的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我无法信任一个杀人狂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "那你应该信不过自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "的确。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "W，再说一句让我信得过的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "啊？你，这......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "阿米娅，为了这片大地......能够安稳入眠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": ".....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿米娅，对我来说，梦想是一个遥不可及的东西。啊，每天处理这处理那，真的好累好累。\n但我是有那样一个梦的。这个梦让我觉得，无论我在这里投入多少精力，都是有意义的。\n如果晚上睡觉的时候有爸爸妈妈在身边，阿米娅是不是会开心许多呢？\n是的，是的。唉，我知道的，可能会闹矛盾吧？\n因为白天打翻家具晚上挑食的事情闹脾气什么的，也是可能的。可不要和凯尔希闹脾气哦，她不是有心那样的。我知道，乖孩子。\n是的，不管怎么样，我们总会因为有爸爸妈妈在所以放心一些的。\n在黑暗里，爸爸妈妈就像是一盏台灯吧。角落里藏着的黑色怪物，窗外的滴着口水的野兽，都会被爸爸妈妈赶走的。\n更想他们了？哎，我......\n没事，没事。阿米娅，没事。有我在这儿呢。\n没事的，阿米娅。因为爸爸妈妈肯定也是这样想的。哪怕平常有很多烦心事，在看着宝宝的时候，父母也是会想许多的。\n有的时候，这是我们活下去的唯一理由了。因为......生命在我们死后依然能够延续，不是因为别的，而是因为有人能活下去。这是支撑着我们向前走的理由。\n我不想孩子失去父母，也不希望父母失去孩子。\n这片大地上，随意夺走别人生命的事不断地重复，总有些什么会夺走我们爱的那些人，夺走那些支撑着我们走下去的人......\n那些事情，甚至会发生在亲子之间。只因为一些词语，一些想法......他们之间竟然充满了仇恨。\n因为受伤流出来的血是没法灌溉农田的。一年又一年积压出的痛是不会结出甜果子的。\n阿米娅，我们是很脆弱的。我们的泪水会流进沙土，种子也不会在那里发芽。\n所以，我有一个很远很远的梦想。\n我想这片大地上的居民不再只是为着离别和失去哭泣，我不想我们的夜空被心碎和空虚塞满。\n我想着，也许有一天......我们会一起让这片大地上的每一个人，都能平静入梦。\n嗯，每一个人。我们也是其中的一部分。\n哪怕那个未来不会来，哪怕这片大地会陷入黑暗也一样。阿米娅，我们活在这里，不是为了一个答案。\n现在，罗德岛还在它的航线上呜呜地开着。一切都照常运行，哪怕我们到不了终点。\n睡吧，晚安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "兔子，不......阿米娅！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "让我，这一次就让我再为议长做些什么吧！让我为这些还没死的人，做些什么吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "就帮我这一次！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿米娅手中的黑色长剑缓缓化作飞灰，在风中散去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我知道了。W，这一次我相信你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......为了这片大地能够安稳入眠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "靠你了，W。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡特斯女孩将一个盒子推进了萨卡兹的手中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "老爷子，你的临终心愿我也知道，就让我他妈把这座城给你停......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......？在哪输口令？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "等等，这钥匙......什么东西？这钥匙根本就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指令明白",
      "text": "（乌萨斯语）警告，权限不足。此秘钥只能用于启动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "权限不够是什么玩意儿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......你说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "听我说，这玩意虽然是个钥匙......但是......没用。这把钥匙权限不够。连市长都没有权限，这机器要谁才能停？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "所以，从头到尾，所有人都被......都被骗了......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "但是移动城市核心城一定有紧急制动钥匙！除非，除非......除非钥匙已经被烧......烧掉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......不对。不对！米莎......？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "不......不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "还不至于。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "钥匙在我这。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "你这龙女......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "啊。哈，你准不准备给我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "你要是打算把你那个邪恶计划坚持到底——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "接住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "嘿，到手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "真正的你......还挺直爽的，我开始有点喜欢你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "油嘴滑舌的萨卡兹......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "把它直接按在控制面板上，你知道之后该怎么做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "口令我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "阿米娅，站稳了，我可不知道这是不是一闸到底！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "怎么念来着......唔，（乌萨斯语）为了喂饱所有人民？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "对......是那个口令。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "这把钥匙，你是从哪里得到的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "呵......这把钥匙原本就挂在制动室的墙上。只要有口令，谁都能用。只是因为从没人想过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "......没想过这么荒诞的发展和这么残酷的骗局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "为了支走游击队，为了诱骗近卫局，这几把秘钥......根本只是我哄骗他们的谎言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我利用了他们对大移动城市的不了解，利用了碎骨和爱国者的信任，明明这是......他们最后一次信任我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "（乌萨斯语）为了喂饱所有人民。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "5:42p.m.\n这个铁块不情愿地轰鸣着，放慢了它冲向毁灭的脚步。\n终于，切尔诺伯格核心城停在了龙门的舰炮射程之外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "也没我想象中那么危险，只能说，好在我们还能把它停下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "咻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......龙女，你居然没毁掉钥匙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "喂，不说话装哑巴？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "——因为她不想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "科西切肯定千方百计地想诱导她，想让她把这把钥匙毁掉，但是他做不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "因为......有那么一点无法抹去，或者说没法被法术动摇的良知在那里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "可能因为她是从没想过。即使她曾经因为一念之差想过要毁掉所有人，却也从来没想要断掉那条路吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "那条感染者至少还能挣扎着活下去的路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......站起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "别这样。你已经够让人失望了。站起来，塔露拉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "站起来，塔露拉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你面对的是什么？你自己不是说过吗，不管你是真心的还是假心假意的，不管你是自己说的还是借别人的嘴巴说的，你自己知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你说你的敌人是这片腐朽的大地。你知道这意味着什么吗，塔露拉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "不对，你比我更明白......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "为了感染者，不，为了打碎感染者和普通人之间的这面高墙，为了消灭那些丑陋的谋杀和恶毒的奴役。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "和感染者们一起战斗了多少年的你，当然会比我更明白......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你明白的，面对这片大地，你毫无胜算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你没有一点取胜的机会......他们会压倒你，污蔑你，溺死你，唾弃你，欺骗你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你只要敢站出来，他们就敢把你拖进最肮脏的地方里，用最污秽的办法去对付你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你只要犯下一个错误就会被打倒，你的敌人却无穷无尽。你选择走上前来，选择和他们对抗，选择投进你的生命，你的敌人却不朽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你只有一个结局，你会被打倒，你会被毁掉，哪怕你只走错一步！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你只要走错一步，这一步就成了他们伤害你的理由......名正言顺地伤害你的理由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "他们就像恶兽闻到血腥味一样扑上来，撕扯你的肉，扒掉你的舌头和眼睛，还嚎叫着侮辱你的尊严！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "但人怎么可能不犯错？所以你一定会倒下。你会被打倒在地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......但你不能，你比我还清楚，塔露拉，你不能倒下......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "就算他们都盯着你！就算他们都瞄着你身上所有的弱点，就算他们都想着扯开你的外皮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "就算他们要把你的一切都挂出来嘲笑和唾弃，侮蔑你是废物和欲望过剩的幼稚混球......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你也不能倒下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......我们在各自的城市里活成了对方不知道的样子。过去的日子不会再来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我们已经有了各自的事业。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "但现在，我没有做到......你也没有做到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "明明路还很长。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "因为我们的事情还没做完。即使这事业没有结束的那天也一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你应该比我更懂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "塔露拉，你的路，一样很长。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "哗，厉害啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "（瞪了W一眼。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "嗯？哎？算了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "警官不再言语。\n因为战士站了起来。慢慢地，她站了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "你什么时候变得这么牙尖爪利了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "真该让阿丽娜也看看你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你终于愿意开口了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "——在这之前，我要先逮捕你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "谁会审判我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "还没有人。乌萨斯和龙门......都没有审判你的资格。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我还没有落魄到要被亲人包庇，在耻辱中苟延残喘的地步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "错了，塔露拉。是因为这片大地上还没有那个足够公正，足够审判你的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "足够审判感染者的地方，到现在都还不存在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "这就是你的理想吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "......建立那个能够公平审判所有人，无论他们是谁，来自哪里，有没有得病的那个地方？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "这不是理想。这是我的工作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "好久不见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "好久不见，姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "看来我救到你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "但我也不会束手就擒的。即使......是现在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我还不敢死去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你可以......弥补。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我什么都不能弥补。我在一个冬天里毁掉了无数人的一切。任何一个人都没有资格去弥补什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "只是我还......不能死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我不能死。我死了就是结束。我死了就是让他们得逞，就是让那些只有我还记着名字的人死去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你会活下去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "也许我不配。但我不配在这里死去，我根本配不上这么轻而易举地一死了之。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "——这片大地是不能重来的。发生过的都发生过了，没发生的还会继续发生，坠下的雨水湿润土地，死去的一切都不会再回。 ​​​",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "......我要活着。要活到我有资格为他们殉死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "小时候我们玩过一个游戏。脸三分，胸口五分，腰两分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我也不知道魏彦吾为什么会教我们那个。但我觉得还挺有用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "那是我在学校里被其他小孩打了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "因为你护着碧翠克斯。你被打得很惨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "但不是被你打的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "现在的我两下就能制服你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "......你试试。你的确变得很好强。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "把剑放下吧，你拿那个其实有点好笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "那么大家就空手。顺便，这把赤霄是圆了你的什么侠客美梦吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "“美食美酒美景，美人美善美谈”，你得着那些稀奇古怪的小说里的哪个梦了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "喂！别说了......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "​​你不会还在看那些吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......我一定打得你说不出话来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "不过，谢谢你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "谢她，不要谢我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你该谢的是那只勇敢的小兔子，以及那些和她并肩战斗的感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "她才是那个凭着良知一步一步踩着你的熔岩和火焰走到这儿的人。这个阿米娅才是真正救了你的人。​",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "那之前......先解决我们两个之间的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我们间就只剩那么一点东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "不，塔露拉。未来还长。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "啊，她们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "没事的，小兔子。每个人都有一个要被打得粉碎的过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "W小姐，我想知道......为什么你会知道停止核心城的制动口令？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "所有人都得有些秘密渠道吧？这个答案我一点也不想回答。你会杀了我吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "但看在你刚才相信我的份上，我可以回答你......如果你不生气的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "你是说米莎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "不，是亚历克斯。碎骨。嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "是他父亲在死前和他这么说的。他的父亲并不傻。整合运动要做什么，他大概也知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "但他没有能力阻止什么，就像他既没有阻止乌萨斯屠杀他的同事，也没能阻止自己的儿女双双死去。哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "只是那时我们都没能理解，至少我到刚刚才理解......在这之前，科西切这个老骗子骗了我们所有人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我，爱国者老爷子，霜星，浮士德，梅菲斯特，碎骨，弑君者，全都被骗了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "米莎原本是不用死的。我一开始为了让切城动不起来，就那么害了她，后来又因为停不下切城，后悔杀了她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "就那个时候，我已经觉得我的白痴会毁掉所有人，幸亏那龙女还算有点良知。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "这是我的错。对了，我可不会乞求原谅什么的。当时我可一点没觉得自己做错了什么事。如果每个人都按常理办事，这片大地早死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "但是米莎已经死去了。我们永远没法弥补这个错误。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "W，以后这一切都不会再发生。我不会允许你再这样做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "你要么答应我，要么，我们会把你囚禁在罗德岛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "即使你尝试去拯救许多人......但一个人也是人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "哦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "呼，看来塔露拉已经体力不支。那样纵容自己身体释放的法术，可不会让她有多好过的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "啊。她倒下了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "喂，兔子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我不知道我有没有说过，嗯，怎么说呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "小兔子，嗯。小兔子，你有点像她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "再见了，阿米娅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "真心希望，呵呵，我真心希望我这种人不会再和你见面。不要再见面了，罗德岛的兔子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "啊，W！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "停下了......切尔诺伯格停下了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "做得好！做得好罗德岛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员？",
      "text": "敌人在撤退......？敌人陷入混乱了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "text": "要追吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员？",
      "text": "他们在四处逃窜——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员？",
      "text": "！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员？",
      "text": "他们感受到了。他们被抛弃了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "我们胜了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "我们......我们做到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈！！我们感染者齐力同心！就是这样！这一切都亏了你们！罗德岛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "啊......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "万岁！小猫！你真厉害！我们做到了！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾卫",
      "text": "万岁！！罗德岛的菲林！",
